type: ItemTurret
requirements: [
phighthouseium/200
]
name: "PHIGHTHOUSE Bullet Hell"
description: '''
Basically touhou if it was phighthouse.
[orange]coilium: fast projectiles, non-homing.
[][#ff0638]subspaceium: much faster, homing, less damage.
[white]whitehouseium: slower, homing, more damage.
[cyan]hyperlaserium: hit-scan lasers, hope you weren't in the scan.
[][#af2020]katanaium: heavy damage, slow, applies unmoving.
[purple]phighthouseium: same speed as coilium, extreme homing power, large damage.
'''
